    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50657" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππ-ᾰγωγός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
